# The proof that the dev-only screens are out of the release build (2026-10-22).
# The command was scripts/dev/check-dev-screens.mjs: it exports the app twice
# (the release export and the lab export) and reads the two bundles. Only the
# result lines are kept here; the export output is not.

=== the release export (no EXPO_PUBLIC_DESIGN_LAB, no EXPO_PUBLIC_E2E) ===
  compat-screen: 0 occurrence(s) in the bundle
  design-index: 0 occurrence(s) in the bundle
  today-screen (the product): 1 occurrence(s) in the bundle
=== the lab export (EXPO_PUBLIC_DESIGN_LAB=1) ===
  compat-screen: 1 occurrence(s) in the bundle
  design-index: 1 occurrence(s) in the bundle
check-dev-screens: the dev-only screens are in the lab build and out of the release build
